<title>JAPAN: Fuji Univance to issue 35 mln Sfr warrant.</title>
<headline>Fuji Univance to issue 35 mln Sfr warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Fuji Univance Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Swiss Bank Corp</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Shizuoka Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   35 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON 0.5%	    ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 24.Jul.01</p>
<p> EXER PRICE 603 yen   CURR RATE 78.40/Sfr</p>
<p> EXER FROM 8.Aug.97   EXER TO 10.Jul.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 24.Jul.97  INT PAY 24.Jul</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 11.Jul.97 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
</text>
